      "arabic": "١٢٣٠٤- أم يحيى:\nفي المبهمات، حديثها عند\nيحيى بن الحصين عن أمه، ويقال عن جدته، قالت: سمعت رسول اللَّه ﵌ يقول: «اسمعوا وأطيعوا وإن أمّر عليكم عبد ...» الحديث.",
      "english": "12304—Umm Yahya\n\nAmong the unidentified women. Her hadith is related by Yahya ibn al-Husayn, from his mother—or, it is said, from his grandmother—who said: “I heard the Messenger of Allah—may Allah bless him and grant him peace—say: ‘Hear and obey, even if a slave is appointed to command you …’” to the end of the hadith.",
